  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine coleslaw mix, celery, sunflower kernels, green onion, and white onion in a large bowl; stir in mayonnaise. Sprinkle salad generously with vinegar, black pepper, and salt; adjust to desired consistency and flavor. Refrigerate coleslaw 8 hours to overnight; adjust seasoning if desired.",
